{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Private Placements (SEC Form D)"},"description":"SEC Form D exempt-offering notices (Reg D 504/506, Section 4(a)): one row per filing. Amounts: null = not stated, 0 = stated zero; rows stored before 2026-08-17 cannot tell which. Null fails min_amount_sold, sorts last. Only filing_id, issuer_cik, issuer_state, federal_exemption, is_amendment and a 4+ character issuer_name search all filings; other filters and sorts use the newest 2,000 those select (coverage_warning says so). More: keyvex.com/docs/tools/get_private_placements","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"federal_exemption":{"description":"Exact: 06b=506(b), 06c=506(c), 04(2)=4(a)(2), 3C.1/3C.7=ICA 3(c)(1)/3(c)(7).","type":"string"},"filing_id":{"description":"Accession number.","type":"string"},"industry_group_type":{"description":"Substring.","type":"string"},"investment_fund_type":{"description":"Substring.","type":"string"},"is_amendment":{"type":"boolean"},"issuer_cik":{"type":"string"},"issuer_name":{"description":"Substring; 1-3 chars: whole word.","type":"string"},"issuer_state":{"description":"2-letter.","type":"string"},"jurisdiction_of_inc":{"description":"Substring.","type":"string"},"limit":{"description":"Default 50.","maximum":500,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"min_amount_sold":{"description":"total_amount_sold >= this.","type":"number"},"since":{"description":"YYYY-MM-DD, inclusive, on date_of_first_sale.","type":"string"},"sort_by":{"description":"Default file_date.","enum":["file_date","date_of_first_sale","total_amount_sold"],"type":"string"},"sort_order":{"description":"Default desc.","enum":["asc","desc"],"type":"string"},"until":{"description":"YYYY-MM-DD, inclusive, on date_of_first_sale.","type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"name":"get_private_placements"}
